          <mx:String>In a 25 mL round-bottomed flask (t=g) was 5-chloro-7-(cyclopropylamino)pyrazolo[1,5-a]pyrimidine-3-carbonitrile (40 mg, 0.17 mmol), Pd2(dba)3 (7.84 mg, 8.56 µmol), and [Reactants] in DMA (1.5 mL) ([VOLUME]) to give a black suspension.[Reactants] and N-(5-amino-2-methylphenyl)acetamide (28.1 mg, 0.17 mmol) were added.  stirred at 110C for 2 days. TLC showed major is SM, small amount of product was formed/  did not workup  LCMS showed 349 mass ??  </mx:String>
        </mx:Field>
